    }

    /// Floor 7's first embedded mini-game, "EMPLOYEE APTITUDE TEST /
    /// TIC-TAC-TOE" (Eddie, Sept 13) -- a wall-mounted terminal the
    /// player approaches and faces, same footprint/mount height as
